PREAMBLE

This license governs the use, reproduction, modification, and distribution of
the software and associated documentation files collectively referred to as
"JARVIS" (the "Software"). It is designed to protect the author's work while
remaining open to individuals who want to learn from, build upon, or adapt it
for personal and non-commercial purposes.

The name "POV" stands for Personal Open View — reflecting the intent that this
work is shared openly for personal benefit and education, while the author
retains meaningful rights over how it is used commercially and how it is
presented to the world.

